      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": {
        "content": "Short-term memory makes a conversation coherent today. Long-term memory builds a reliable relationship over time. A well-designed business agent needs to know which one to use, when to use it, and what the risks of each are. Both types are part of the architecture.",
        "link": null
       },
       "annotations": {
